# 1.4: the journey's glide, begun by hand. Sixteen bars: the layers thin out (the Lead, Sequence 2, Sequence 1, the
# Drone and the Atmosphere), the piece changes under the tail, the new one's layers come in. It never saves; a touch
# before the change keeps the piece, after it brings the new one in whole
wait 500
expect playing 1
expect piece 0
expect dirty 0
expect jr 0
bar 8
journey 1
wait 100
expect jr 1
# the Lead out first (4), then Sequence 2 (8|16), Sequence 1 (2), the Drone and the Atmosphere (1|32)
expect jrmask 4
bar 10
wait 200
expect jrmask 28
bar 12
wait 200
expect jrmask 30
bar 14
wait 200
expect jrmask 63
expect piece 0
bar 16
wait 200
# the piece changed; the Drone and the Atmosphere back
expect piece 1
expect jrmask 30
expect dirty 0
bar 24
wait 300
expect jr 0
expect jrmask 0
expect piece 1
expect dirty 0
expect store_writes 0
# a touch before the change: the piece stays, nothing held out
journey 2
wait 100
expect jr 1
bar 27
turn K2 1
wait 100
expect jr 0
expect jrmask 0
expect piece 1
# a touch after the change: the new piece, whole
bar 32
journey 2
bar 42
wait 300
expect piece 2
expect jr >0
tapkey 5
wait 100
expect jr 0
expect jrmask 0
expect piece 2
# to the piece playing: not begun, nothing changes
wait 12000
expect store_writes <2
